The function also considers future extensibility by using a dynamically allocated array of `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T` structures to store the list of CRC indication PDUs. The `num_ues` parameter is used to determine the size of this array, which can be adjusted as needed.

Overall, this implementation provides a scalable and maintainable solution for handling a large number of concurrent UE contexts and bearers with efficient memory management and performance constraints.']

